{"type":"text","id":"ov_cap","x":40,"y":796,"width":1600,"height":80,"text":"1  automator starts XRClaw on the phone, then the coordinator and the two workers\n2  coordinator hands out one question at a time to agent_tester\n3  agent_tester talks to Gemini Live on the glasses, records the reply, and reads the real app state via XRClaw\n4  judge_worker scores the reply (rules first, VLM fallback); automator builds reports and re-runs weak answers","originalText":"1  automator starts XRClaw on the phone, then the coordinator and the two workers\n2  coordinator hands out one question at a time to agent_tester\n3  agent_tester talks to Gemini Live on the glasses, records the reply, and reads the real app state via XRClaw\n4  judge_worker scores the reply (rules first, VLM fallback); automator builds reports and re-runs weak answers","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1121,"version":1,"versionNonce":2121,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
